WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.080 --> 00:00:02.250
What?

00:00:03.380 --> 00:00:04.710
Don't move.

00:00:05.290 --> 00:00:06.210
Who are you?

00:00:06.300 --> 00:00:11.340
I shall ask you
the same question, abnormality.

00:00:11.930 --> 00:00:18.350
I could not help but overhear you say
that you want to go back to "that side."

00:00:18.850 --> 00:00:23.350
I must be mistaken, but would you happen
to be travelers from another world?

00:00:23.440 --> 00:00:25.360
Something like that.

00:00:25.440 --> 00:00:26.360
I knew it!

00:00:26.440 --> 00:00:29.780
Are you one of the Demon King's thugs?

00:00:29.860 --> 00:00:31.450
Demon King?

00:00:31.530 --> 00:00:35.780
Right. That huge guy.
I know where he resides.

00:00:36.700 --> 00:00:38.580
You know where he is? Really?

00:00:38.660 --> 00:00:42.120
I can guide you to him.

00:00:42.210 --> 00:00:45.080
However, I shall require your help.

00:00:47.460 --> 00:00:49.130
What are you…

00:00:52.720 --> 00:00:55.800
-What?
-I am Wild!

00:00:55.890 --> 00:00:59.520
I am a warrior
who searches for my lost brother!

00:01:01.060 --> 00:01:03.190
-Master?
-Hawk?

00:01:03.850 --> 00:01:05.860
What? I said my name was "Wild."

